              "type": "text",
              "content": "{\"time\":1700005008000,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"mM5nN6oO7p\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"In English cities, there are many ways to travel:\"}},{\"id\":\"pP8qQ9rR0s\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"<b>by bus</b> — на автобусе\",\"<b>by train</b> — на поезде\",\"<b>by taxi / cab</b> — на такси\",\"<b>by underground / metro</b> — на метро\",\"<b>on foot / walk</b> — пешком\",\"<b>by bike / bicycle</b> — на велосипеде\"]}},{\"id\":\"sS1tT2uU3v\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Useful questions:\"}},{\"id\":\"vV4wW5xX6y\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"<b>Which bus goes to the city centre?</b>\",\"<b>Where is the nearest bus stop?</b>\",\"<b>How long does it take?</b>\"]}},{\"id\":\"yY7zZ8aA9b\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Example: <em>I go to work <b>by bus</b>. It takes about 20 minutes.</em>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.4\"}"
